zlib 1.4, vendored for the programs; src/SDK/ZLIB/zlib121 is the exe's 1.2.1.

Source: https://zlib.net/zlib-1.4.tar.gz (also https://github.com/madler/zlib/releases/tag/v1.4)
sha256: 02dd159783677a749c04adbdd02b55b8a2bcc7e054f51b76b549199a916ad584 (checked against the hash zlib.net publishes)

Kept from the tarball, unchanged: the library sources adler32, compress, crc32, deflate, inffast, inflate, inftrees,
trees, uncompr and zutil (.c), their headers (crc32.h, deflate.h, inffast.h, inffixed.h, inflate.h, inftrees.h,
trees.h, zutil.h, and gzguts.h, which zutil.c includes), zlib.h, zconf.h and LICENSE. Left out: the gz* and infback
sources, examples, tests, contrib and build files. CMake builds them as fnvd_zlib (CMakeLists.txt).
